            <Title>Thematic Ideas</Title>
            <Text>Thematic Ideas  Content
 unpacks the main themes of the play, as well as digs deeper into some of the more subtle themes. These include...
 •	Madness 
•	Revenge 
•	Religion 
•	Subversion of Relationships 
•	Delay 
•	Honor 
•	Ambiguity of Language 
•	Human Beings 
•	Political Intrigues 
•	Suicide 
This  also digs more into the complicated themes in Hamlet.
